WEBVTT

00:00:03.270 --> 00:00:05.270
A festival?

00:00:05.270 --> 00:00:05.860
That's right!

00:00:05.860 --> 00:00:06.730
It's a fireworks display!

00:00:07.230 --> 00:00:09.230
Yami-san, you should come with us.

00:00:09.230 --> 00:00:11.610
Tearju-san said she would come, as well.

00:00:12.030 --> 00:00:15.570
I heard about your relationship with Tearju-san.

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:17.620
Is that so?

00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:20.580
Rito said he hoped to see you there.

00:00:26.670 --> 00:00:30.000
I'll be waiting for you, so be sure to come, okay?

00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:36.010
That's not your concern, Yuuki Rito.

00:00:57.820 --> 00:01:01.330
<b>fushigi na yasuragi kanshou</b>

00:00:57.820 --> 00:01:01.330
<b>不思議な安らぎ観賞</b>

00:00:57.820 --> 00:01:01.330
<b>This strange feeling of peaceful enjoyment</b>

00:01:01.330 --> 00:01:03.910
<b>shibaraku kono mama</b>

00:01:01.330 --> 00:01:03.910
<b>しばらくこのまま</b>

00:01:01.330 --> 00:01:03.910
<b>Will continue for a while</b>

00:01:04.710 --> 00:01:08.500
<b>rikai funou puroburemu bousou</b>

00:01:04.710 --> 00:01:08.500
<b>理解不能プロブレム暴走</b>

00:01:04.710 --> 00:01:08.500
<b>An impossible to solve problem runs wild</b>

00:01:09.630 --> 00:01:11.800
<b>genin wa?</b>

00:01:09.630 --> 00:01:11.800
<b>原因は？</b>

00:01:09.630 --> 00:01:11.800
<b>And the cause is?</b>

00:01:11.550 --> 00:01:18.260
<b>kimi to iru to kudaranai oshie wasureru</b>

00:01:11.550 --> 00:01:18.260
<b>君といるとくだらない教え忘れる</b>

00:01:11.550 --> 00:01:18.260
<b>Whenever I'm with you, I forget all about these boring lessons</b>

00:01:18.390 --> 00:01:26.060
<b>kono henka kara umaretahonshin ukeireyou</b>

00:01:18.390 --> 00:01:26.060
<b>この変化から生まれた本心受け入れよう</b>

00:01:18.390 --> 00:01:26.060
<b>I want you to accept the true feelings born from this change</b>

00:01:26.100 --> 00:01:30.020
<b>harimegutta saisho no kokoro</b>

00:01:26.100 --> 00:01:30.020
<b>張り巡った最初の心</b>

00:01:26.100 --> 00:01:30.020
<b>I reeled in the first heart I could hook</b>

00:01:29.770 --> 00:01:33.480
<b>taguriyose sotto seebushita</b>

00:01:29.770 --> 00:01:33.480
<b>手繰り寄せそっとセーブした</b>

00:01:29.770 --> 00:01:33.480
<b>Carefully saving it</b>

00:01:33.230 --> 00:01:38.110
<b>hyouteki ni fukuzatsu na mune no yami takushite</b>

00:01:33.230 --> 00:01:38.110
<b>標的に複雑な胸の闇託して</b>

00:01:33.230 --> 00:01:38.110
<b>I use the complicated darkness in my heart on my target</b>

00:01:37.860 --> 00:01:41.200
<b>Care me! Care me! Care me! Care me!</b>

00:01:37.860 --> 00:01:41.200
<b></b>

00:01:37.860 --> 00:01:41.200
<b></b>

00:01:41.330 --> 00:01:47.210
<b>naiteru kokoro atatamete yatto kizuita</b>

00:01:41.330 --> 00:01:47.210
<b>泣いてる心温めてやっと気づいた</b>

00:01:41.330 --> 00:01:47.210
<b>As I warmed the crying heart, I finally realised</b>

00:01:47.290 --> 00:01:56.050
<b>watashi no himitsu heiki wa nani yori mo tsuyoku katakumusunda</b>

00:01:47.290 --> 00:01:56.050
<b>私の秘密兵器はなによりも強く硬く結んだ</b>

00:01:47.290 --> 00:01:56.050
<b>That more than anything, my secret weapon is strongly, firmly bound</b>

00:01:55.800 --> 00:01:59.300
<b>kimi to no tsunagari</b>

00:01:55.800 --> 00:01:59.300
<b>君との繋がり</b>

00:01:55.800 --> 00:01:59.300
<b>With my connection to you</b>

