00:02:06.180 --> 00:02:09.770
<b>「Summer festival</b>

00:02:06.180 --> 00:02:09.770
<b>「Summer festival</b>

00:02:06.180 --> 00:02:09.770
<b>~The Festival Begins~」</b>

00:02:06.180 --> 00:02:09.770
<b>~The Festival Begins~」</b>

00:02:18.780 --> 00:02:21.030
I'm going to eat some cotton candy!

00:02:21.030 --> 00:02:23.740
Nana! If you run around too much, you'll trip.

00:02:24.540 --> 00:02:26.000
Yukatas, huh?

00:02:26.450 --> 00:02:31.880
Momo's cute, of course, but Nana has a completely different atmosphere from her usual boyish feel.

00:02:34.880 --> 00:02:37.010
What are you staring at, you beast?!

00:02:37.010 --> 00:02:37.760
Uh, it's nothing.

00:02:41.430 --> 00:02:44.350
If you want it that much, I'll give you a bite.

00:02:44.350 --> 00:02:45.770
T-Thank you.

00:02:46.100 --> 00:02:49.690
It's about time for me to meet up with Mea, so I'll be going now.

00:02:49.690 --> 00:02:53.190
Ah, we'll meet back up on the grounds 
around the time of the fireworks, okay?

00:02:53.190 --> 00:02:54.270
I got it, already!

00:02:54.270 --> 00:02:55.440
Stop treating me like a child!

00:02:57.150 --> 00:02:58.780
Good grief, Nana.

00:02:59.400 --> 00:03:00.740
Because of what happened before,

00:03:00.740 --> 00:03:04.580
she's starting to become more conscious of you, Rito-san.

00:03:04.580 --> 00:03:06.620
What are you talking about, so suddenly?!

00:03:08.620 --> 00:03:09.750
Rito?

00:03:09.750 --> 00:03:10.710
Mikan!

00:03:10.960 --> 00:03:12.630
Are you still with the teachers?

00:03:12.630 --> 00:03:13.210
Yeah.

00:03:13.630 --> 00:03:15.710
Tearju-san is a really nice person, isn't she?

00:03:15.710 --> 00:03:18.300
I want to hear more about Yami-san,

00:03:18.300 --> 00:03:20.170
so I'll be here for a while, okay?

00:03:20.170 --> 00:03:21.340
Okay.

00:03:22.680 --> 00:03:26.720
Aren't you glad that you were able to
introduce Tearju-sensei to Mikan-san?

00:03:26.720 --> 00:03:27.890
Yeah.

00:03:27.890 --> 00:03:30.980
The relationship between Nana and Mea has made progress,

00:03:31.310 --> 00:03:37.150
so it would be nice if Mikan could mediate a
better relationship between Tearju and Yami.

00:03:37.820 --> 00:03:41.900
There's also the option of having you mediate it, isn't there, Rito-san?

00:03:41.900 --> 00:03:43.700
Like the way you did when you hugged Nana.

00:03:43.700 --> 00:03:44.120
Eh!?

00:03:44.120 --> 00:03:45.160
You knew about that?!

00:03:45.450 --> 00:03:46.530
Of course!

00:03:46.530 --> 00:03:50.410
The situation then was urgent, so... Um...

00:03:50.410 --> 00:03:51.910
This person...

00:03:52.670 --> 00:03:55.420
He's always so kind, worrying about other people.

00:03:56.840 --> 00:03:59.840
I wonder, if I were down about something,

00:03:59.840 --> 00:04:03.340
would he hug me like that too?

00:04:03.340 --> 00:04:04.760
Momo-sama!

00:04:04.760 --> 00:04:06.640
I didn't expect to see you in a place like this!

00:04:06.640 --> 00:04:08.600
Oh, they're from your fan club...

00:04:08.600 --> 00:04:11.060
Nakajima-san and Sugimura-san.

00:04:11.680 --> 00:04:14.650
You look so beautiful in a yukata, Momo-sama!

00:04:14.650 --> 00:04:17.690
I told you to stop calling me "sama"!

00:04:17.690 --> 00:04:20.110
I really didn't expect to run into you, Momo-sama.

00:04:20.110 --> 00:04:22.950
It seems it was worthwhile to come here, even if it is just the two of us.

00:04:22.950 --> 00:04:24.570
You must come with us-

00:04:25.870 --> 00:04:29.660
Y-Yuuki Rito-senpai is with you?

00:04:29.660 --> 00:04:30.540
Yes.

00:04:30.540 --> 00:04:32.330
Momo-sama, come here a moment.

00:04:32.330 --> 00:04:33.040
Yes?

00:04:33.330 --> 00:04:35.460
Please be careful, Momo-sama.

00:04:35.460 --> 00:04:36.380
What is it?

00:04:36.380 --> 00:04:38.750
I'd prefer if you didn't have your face so close to me.

00:04:38.750 --> 00:04:41.260
Men are all beasts!

00:04:41.260 --> 00:04:48.470
Even if you think you're safe you never know when he'll
transform into a wild beast because of your charm, Momo-sama!

00:04:48.470 --> 00:04:51.390
Um, I can hear everything you're saying...

00:04:51.390 --> 00:04:52.600
Yes.

00:04:52.600 --> 00:04:53.640
In other words...

00:04:56.600 --> 00:04:59.940
Seeing you lick that candy apple...

00:05:01.440 --> 00:05:03.360
Or that white nape...!

00:05:03.360 --> 00:05:07.620
Having his dark desire awakened, Yuuki-senpai would...

00:05:08.660 --> 00:05:10.870
Rito-san, what are you doing in a place like this?

00:05:12.870 --> 00:05:16.040
Look! More candy apples!

00:05:16.040 --> 00:05:18.500
Lick them!

00:05:18.500 --> 00:05:22.130
Hey! Lick more, Momo!

00:05:29.680 --> 00:05:32.970
I can't handle any more!

00:05:33.680 --> 00:05:35.940
If you're going to give up, then...

00:05:35.940 --> 00:05:37.270
Eh?!

00:05:37.270 --> 00:05:37.810
Look!

00:05:38.310 --> 00:05:41.070
There, there, there!

00:05:42.270 --> 00:05:44.320
There, there, there, there!

00:05:45.690 --> 00:05:48.070
If you put in that many...!

00:05:48.660 --> 00:05:50.070
Inside...!

00:05:54.700 --> 00:05:58.580
I'll get soaked...!

00:05:58.580 --> 00:06:03.340
You damn brute!

00:06:00.880 --> 00:06:02.130
Calm down, Nakajima!

00:06:02.130 --> 00:06:03.340
You're the one who's a brute!

00:06:04.630 --> 00:06:06.090
Momo-sama has disappeared!

00:06:06.090 --> 00:06:07.840
This way, Rito-san!

00:06:07.840 --> 00:06:10.260
Are you sure it was okay to leave them?

00:06:10.260 --> 00:06:11.800
It's fine.

00:06:12.600 --> 00:06:17.850
I feel kind of bad for Nakajima-san, but I don't want anyone to interfere with our chance to be alone.

00:06:21.060 --> 00:06:23.520
But they were pretty rude, though.

00:06:24.070 --> 00:06:26.490
Saying that I would become a wild beast or something like that.

00:06:26.490 --> 00:06:29.610
Oh, but you are a beast, Rito-san.

00:06:29.610 --> 00:06:31.490
Only when you're asleep, though.

00:06:31.490 --> 00:06:32.030
Eh?

00:06:32.030 --> 00:06:34.330
Did I do something when I was asleep?

00:06:35.080 --> 00:06:39.000
It used to be only about one time in five that you'd attack,

00:06:39.000 --> 00:06:42.590
but recently it's more like two or three out of five.

00:06:42.960 --> 00:06:47.510
Your technique is becoming gradually more intense, Rito-san.

00:06:47.510 --> 00:06:49.550
T-Technique...?

00:06:52.340 --> 00:06:54.560
It was a joke.

00:06:54.560 --> 00:06:58.560
We still have time, so why don't we walk around here?

00:07:00.560 --> 00:07:01.560
Haruna!

00:07:01.560 --> 00:07:04.020
Did Yui tell you anything on the phone?

00:07:04.020 --> 00:07:04.690
Yeah.

00:07:05.150 --> 00:07:07.780
Kotegawa-san is taking longer than expected to get ready.

00:07:07.780 --> 00:07:09.070
I see.

00:07:09.450 --> 00:07:11.570
Yuuki-kun is coming today, right?

00:07:11.570 --> 00:07:12.160
Yeah!

00:07:12.160 --> 00:07:13.570
We should be able to see him later!

00:07:13.950 --> 00:07:17.080
Haruna, are you going to confess today?

00:07:17.080 --> 00:07:20.160
W-Well, everyone will be there today, so...

00:07:20.160 --> 00:07:21.500
Ah, that's true.

00:07:21.500 --> 00:07:23.290
Onee-sama and Haruna-san.

00:07:24.920 --> 00:07:26.750
Ah, they're going.

00:07:27.420 --> 00:07:29.550
Should I call out to them?

00:07:32.590 --> 00:07:34.090
But...

00:07:34.090 --> 00:07:35.850
Just a little more...

00:07:37.220 --> 00:07:39.270
Mummy! Look, look!

00:07:39.270 --> 00:07:41.140
Oh, my! That's amazing!

00:07:41.140 --> 00:07:42.980
Now that I think about it...

00:07:43.520 --> 00:07:46.770
What kind of person is your mother?

00:07:46.770 --> 00:07:49.320
My mother?

00:07:49.320 --> 00:07:49.900
Yeah.

00:07:50.190 --> 00:07:54.200
I heard from Lala before that she's very pretty,

00:07:54.200 --> 00:07:56.530
but I don't really know anything about her.

00:07:58.330 --> 00:08:00.160
She's a wonderful person.

00:08:00.540 --> 00:08:02.700
As the Queen of Deviluke,

00:08:02.700 --> 00:08:04.960
she demonstrates assertive leadership in place of father,

00:08:04.960 --> 00:08:10.880
who is not good with politics and works to
maintain diplomacy with the various planets.

00:08:10.880 --> 00:08:17.970
Saying the galaxy that father united continues to remain at
peace due to mother's presence would not be an exaggeration.

00:08:18.600 --> 00:08:22.520
She is a person whom all of us sisters hold in very high regard.

00:08:25.230 --> 00:08:30.990
Um... Don't you feel lonely... since you don't get to see your mother?

00:08:30.990 --> 00:08:32.280
No.

00:08:32.280 --> 00:08:34.740
Mother worries about us as well,

00:08:34.740 --> 00:08:39.160
so she makes time in her crowded schedule to call once in a while.

00:08:39.160 --> 00:08:46.130
I also have Nana, Onee-sama... and you here, so I've never felt lonely.

00:08:47.750 --> 00:08:49.590
If it's possible...

00:08:52.090 --> 00:08:56.640
I want to stay by your side forever.

00:09:00.930 --> 00:09:05.100
I mean, I said I'd help you with the harem,

00:09:05.100 --> 00:09:07.400
so please continue to rely on me, Rito-san!

00:09:10.020 --> 00:09:11.820
Momo...

00:09:12.940 --> 00:09:15.530
Whether it's about my love for Lala,

00:09:15.530 --> 00:09:18.320
or the succession to the Devilukean throne...

00:09:18.660 --> 00:09:25.870
I can understand the theory behind the harem plan being the best way to achieve them, even though it's absurd.

00:09:26.580 --> 00:09:30.630
But... Why are you willing to go so far for it, Momo?

00:09:33.510 --> 00:09:36.510
Is it okay to ask this?

00:09:36.510 --> 00:09:39.760
Depending on the answer, I may get drawn deeper into this.

00:09:41.760 --> 00:09:46.890
That's because... <i>I love you.</i>

00:09:48.100 --> 00:09:56.240
Even if I'm second or third... I want to be loved by you.

00:09:58.030 --> 00:10:01.910
O-Of course, it's so that everyone can be happy!

00:10:01.910 --> 00:10:05.700
I just can't leave you and Onee-sama
alone because you're so constrained!

00:10:06.080 --> 00:10:08.540
Now why don't we start heading towards the grounds?

00:10:12.340 --> 00:10:14.670
I deceived him.

00:10:15.800 --> 00:10:19.300
What Rito-san expected to hear was probably not that.

00:10:20.550 --> 00:10:21.680
But that's okay.

00:10:23.140 --> 00:10:29.060
The fact that the harem plan's foundation is based on my personal feelings should still...

00:10:29.940 --> 00:10:36.150
It's because of the fact that I'm justifying it by saying it's for everyone's happiness that I can deceive Rito-san.

00:10:37.070 --> 00:10:43.160
If it continues like this, the plan may
succeed before Rito-san himself realises it.

00:10:44.870 --> 00:10:47.370
A web of love with no escape!

00:10:49.120 --> 00:10:53.380
But before that, the thing that concerns me is her.

00:10:58.050 --> 00:11:04.390
In that exchange with Mea-san before... Yami-san did not deny it.

00:11:04.810 --> 00:11:07.890
That she was an out-of-place existence in this city.

00:11:08.680 --> 00:11:10.690
Or that she was a weapon.

00:11:11.850 --> 00:11:18.530
Does that mean that Yami-san hasn't broken
away from being the assassin, Golden Darkness?

00:11:18.530 --> 00:11:19.780
I still can't let my guard down.

00:11:19.780 --> 00:11:20.900
Rito!

00:11:22.570 --> 00:11:24.070
Mikan?

00:11:24.070 --> 00:11:26.030
Why are you in such a rush?

00:11:26.030 --> 00:11:28.040
Where's Tearju-sensei?

00:11:28.040 --> 00:11:30.040
That's... Something happened!

00:11:34.420 --> 00:11:36.090
Which way, Mikan?

00:11:36.090 --> 00:11:37.840
It's that way!

00:11:43.340 --> 00:11:44.600
Rito-san?!

00:11:45.300 --> 00:11:47.140
Ouch...

00:11:52.850 --> 00:11:56.570
As usual you are quite skillful at falling, Yuuki Rito.

00:11:58.110 --> 00:11:59.440
Rito-san!

00:12:02.240 --> 00:12:04.280
Don't forget, Yuuki Rito.

00:12:04.740 --> 00:12:08.790
The fact that you are my target has not changed.

00:12:08.790 --> 00:12:12.460
Please try to remember that you continue to live by my whim.

00:12:12.790 --> 00:12:14.330
Yami-san, please calm down!

00:12:14.880 --> 00:12:15.920
That's right, that's right.

00:12:15.920 --> 00:12:17.750
I'm sorry about that, Yami-san.

00:12:17.750 --> 00:12:20.340
It's because I incited him.

00:12:21.090 --> 00:12:23.340
But it's strange, Yami-san.

00:12:23.340 --> 00:12:26.470
You still think of Rito as a target, do you?

00:12:28.180 --> 00:12:31.480
If that's the case, you should just kill him, already.

00:12:31.980 --> 00:12:34.440
I wonder why it is that you don't.

00:12:34.900 --> 00:12:37.980
Is your life in this city that important to you?

00:12:37.980 --> 00:12:43.900
Or perhaps, is it Yuuki Rito himself that's important?

00:12:46.030 --> 00:12:48.950
Is this... trans?

00:12:50.040 --> 00:12:51.450
I see.

00:12:52.410 --> 00:12:57.960
So you've finally made your appearance, Master Nemesis?

00:13:03.510 --> 00:13:07.470
At a time like this, humans are supposed to say "Nice to meet you", aren't they?

00:13:07.800 --> 00:13:13.310
This girl is the absolute existence that Mea-san believes in, Master Nemesis.

00:13:14.140 --> 00:13:17.520
M-Master? A girl this small is?

00:13:20.570 --> 00:13:21.730
Sor-

00:13:21.730 --> 00:13:23.320
Isn't that too abrupt, Rito-san?!

00:13:24.240 --> 00:13:26.070
I- I'm sorry!

00:13:26.070 --> 00:13:27.570
Not bad.

00:13:27.570 --> 00:13:28.950
You caught me off guard.

00:13:29.490 --> 00:13:31.700
But you're still a fool.

00:13:32.370 --> 00:13:35.410
I just showed you a little before, didn't I?

00:13:35.410 --> 00:13:40.630
In the face of trans ability, outward appearance means nothing.

00:13:41.210 --> 00:13:45.630
I can change my appearance as much as needed to get the enemy to let their guard down.

00:13:46.510 --> 00:13:51.100
That's the true value of the trans ability, Yuuki Rito.

00:13:52.060 --> 00:13:54.470
T-That appearance...!

00:13:54.470 --> 00:13:56.350
How useful...!

00:13:56.690 --> 00:13:59.980
You wanted to have a taste of my body, right?

00:14:02.900 --> 00:14:05.150
You really do make amusing expressions.

00:14:05.530 --> 00:14:07.450
So that's why Mea likes you.

00:14:08.740 --> 00:14:11.070
Did you know, Yuuki Rito?

00:14:11.950 --> 00:14:14.490
There are two types of destruction.

00:14:14.490 --> 00:14:18.000
Physical destruction, and psychological destruction.

00:14:18.000 --> 00:14:22.290
I love both of course, but I'm particularly fond of the latter.

00:14:22.630 --> 00:14:24.630
Should I train you?

00:14:24.630 --> 00:14:25.510
Train?!

00:14:25.960 --> 00:14:27.130
That's right.

00:14:27.130 --> 00:14:32.510
I'll train you to become my manservant so that pain
becomes pleasure and just by being stepped on by me,

00:14:32.100 --> 00:14:33.310
I love you!

00:14:32.510 --> 00:14:35.560
you'll be able to reach climax.

00:14:35.180 --> 00:14:36.350
I love you!

00:14:36.810 --> 00:14:39.480
I'm getting aroused, just imagining it!

00:14:39.480 --> 00:14:41.480
What the hell is she saying?!

00:14:41.810 --> 00:14:42.900
Hey, you! Wait a moment!

00:14:42.900 --> 00:14:45.820
I won't let you do something like that to Rito-

00:14:47.820 --> 00:14:48.530
Momo?!

00:14:52.660 --> 00:14:55.410
That's a nice voice, Princess Momo.

00:14:55.410 --> 00:14:57.660
It looks like it would be worth playing with you, too.

00:14:58.790 --> 00:15:00.500
How did you know about my tail?

00:15:01.380 --> 00:15:03.590
I'm Mea's master.

00:15:03.590 --> 00:15:05.500
Naturally I have that level of information.

00:15:13.050 --> 00:15:17.810
By the way, that clothing called a yukata is pretty nice.

00:15:17.810 --> 00:15:20.940
You can hide things there in battle, and the design is nice.

00:15:23.690 --> 00:15:27.940
It will be better if I can move my legs easily, so how about this?

00:15:28.400 --> 00:15:29.320
I wonder if it looks good on me?

00:15:32.110 --> 00:15:34.240
Aren't you going to answer me?

00:15:35.080 --> 00:15:39.540
That's unladylike for {someone who's }a princess of Deviluke.

00:15:39.540 --> 00:15:41.870
D-Don't look, Rito-san!

00:15:44.250 --> 00:15:46.840
T-This is humiliating!

00:15:46.840 --> 00:15:50.970
To be tormented like this by someone other than Rito-san in front of him...

00:15:52.430 --> 00:15:54.470
That's enough playing around.

00:15:57.140 --> 00:15:58.600
That was dangerous.

00:15:58.600 --> 00:16:00.180
I didn't know you had a technique like that.

00:16:00.520 --> 00:16:01.730
Momo...

00:16:05.190 --> 00:16:06.610
Oh, scary.

00:16:07.320 --> 00:16:09.190
Sorry about that, Princess Momo.

00:16:09.190 --> 00:16:12.820
I didn't come to start a fight.

00:16:12.820 --> 00:16:14.200
I came to say hello.

00:16:14.660 --> 00:16:15.870
To say hello...?

00:16:15.870 --> 00:16:16.740
Yes.

00:16:16.740 --> 00:16:20.330
I want to get along well with you, Golden Darkness.

00:16:20.330 --> 00:16:22.830
As well as the others around you.

00:16:23.620 --> 00:16:24.830
That's...!

00:16:24.830 --> 00:16:27.590
Who would want to be friends with a huge sadist like y-

00:16:27.590 --> 00:16:29.920
You've hidden yourself for all this time,

00:16:29.920 --> 00:16:31.340
why do you show yourself now?

00:16:33.840 --> 00:16:35.930
No special reason.

00:16:35.930 --> 00:16:40.970
It's just because Mea was more suited to finding your whereabouts.

00:16:40.970 --> 00:16:42.980
You've seen my personality, haven't you?

00:16:42.980 --> 00:16:47.060
I don't have confidence in my ability to get along with people and not cause trouble.

00:16:47.060 --> 00:16:49.070
I can understand that.

00:16:49.480 --> 00:16:53.900
So, I built up my courage and took a step forward.

00:16:53.900 --> 00:16:55.820
I cannot accept it.

00:16:55.820 --> 00:17:01.330
Didn't you want me to eliminate Yuuki Rito and return to the path of a weapon?

00:17:01.910 --> 00:17:03.830
Certainly, I did think that.

00:17:04.290 --> 00:17:09.750
That's why I came to survey this city and the people around Mea.

00:17:09.750 --> 00:17:14.170
And now I've come to see your true feelings.

00:17:14.510 --> 00:17:15.680
My true feelings?

00:17:15.680 --> 00:17:18.090
That's right, Golden Darkness.

00:17:18.090 --> 00:17:22.810
You are aware that you are not something that belongs here.

00:17:22.810 --> 00:17:26.060
You understand that you will eventually leave this place.

00:17:26.060 --> 00:17:28.610
Without anyone having to tell you.

00:17:28.610 --> 00:17:31.400
Because you realise it unconsciously.

00:17:31.400 --> 00:17:34.530
Your true self, which sleeps deep inside your heart.

00:17:34.530 --> 00:17:39.620
Your true nature as a weapon, which can never love a person.

00:17:39.620 --> 00:17:41.280
Darkness.

00:17:41.700 --> 00:17:43.200
Darkness?

00:17:43.200 --> 00:17:45.080
So there's no problem.

00:17:45.080 --> 00:17:49.000
Even without my guidance, you will eventually awaken to it.

00:17:49.830 --> 00:17:53.550
Until that time, I will wait patiently.

00:17:53.550 --> 00:17:56.590
If I get bored I'll come to play, so please take care of me.

00:17:56.590 --> 00:17:57.970
Princess Momo.

00:17:57.970 --> 00:17:59.550
Yuuki Rito.

00:17:59.550 --> 00:18:01.600
I refuse.

00:18:01.600 --> 00:18:02.560
Oh, my...

00:18:02.970 --> 00:18:05.390
It looks like I'm hated quite a bit.

00:18:05.390 --> 00:18:07.020
I don't really mind, though.

00:18:07.020 --> 00:18:08.560
Yuuki-kun?

00:18:08.940 --> 00:18:10.690
Momo-chan and Yami-chan, too.

00:18:10.690 --> 00:18:11.570
Kotegawa!

00:18:11.900 --> 00:18:13.820
What are you doing in a place like this?

00:18:16.950 --> 00:18:18.360
What is this?

00:18:19.950 --> 00:18:25.700
Rito-san said he wanted to see you in a yukata, so we came to meet you.

00:18:25.700 --> 00:18:26.790
Momo!

00:18:26.790 --> 00:18:27.460
Eh?

00:18:27.460 --> 00:18:28.500
Is that so?

00:18:28.500 --> 00:18:32.840
Ah... Um... You look nice in your yukata. Really nice.

00:18:34.000 --> 00:18:38.220
You look like a completely different person than when you're always getting angry.

00:18:38.220 --> 00:18:41.470
The reason I'm always getting angry is you, you idiot!

00:18:41.470 --> 00:18:43.220
I-I'm sorry!

00:18:56.650 --> 00:18:59.240
Wow! It's so pretty!

00:18:59.240 --> 00:19:01.870
This really is the perfect place to watch!

00:19:01.870 --> 00:19:03.870
I'm surprised you knew about it, Haruna.

00:19:03.870 --> 00:19:07.080
Yuuki-kun and Mikan-chan told me about it.

00:19:07.080 --> 00:19:09.290
They said they found it together when they were little.

00:19:09.290 --> 00:19:11.210
Oh! Did you see, did you see?!

00:19:11.210 --> 00:19:13.540
That one was amazing!

00:19:13.540 --> 00:19:15.380
Oh, Lala-chi, you're so-

00:19:14.290 --> 00:19:17.300
I never thought they had a master...

00:19:17.300 --> 00:19:18.670
What kind of person was it?

00:19:19.510 --> 00:19:21.970
She was kind of eerie and frightening.

00:19:21.970 --> 00:19:24.220
She was a horrible person.

00:19:24.220 --> 00:19:30.100
But she said something like she wanted to get along well with Yami and all of us.

00:19:30.100 --> 00:19:31.100
Eh?!

00:19:31.100 --> 00:19:33.650
That's obviously a lie!

00:19:33.650 --> 00:19:35.270
She must have something she's after.

00:19:35.270 --> 00:19:37.650
There's no need to worry about that.

00:19:38.110 --> 00:19:45.530
Master said that my living here and growing closer to Yami-oneechan's heart was a good thing.

00:19:45.910 --> 00:19:48.540
I'm sure she came to want to try it out, herself.

00:19:48.540 --> 00:19:50.040
Having contact with people.

00:19:50.040 --> 00:19:52.920
I can't trust something like that.

00:19:52.920 --> 00:19:55.040
Regardless of everyone else, I still won't-

00:19:55.040 --> 00:19:55.790
Oh, my.

00:19:55.790 --> 00:19:59.760
I'm fine with not being liked by you though, Murasame-senpai.

00:20:00.220 --> 00:20:01.590
So unpleasant.

00:20:02.260 --> 00:20:04.300
If you have a problem, I'll take you on.

00:20:04.300 --> 00:20:05.050
So, how about it?

00:20:05.050 --> 00:20:06.760
Just how I want it!

00:20:06.760 --> 00:20:08.010
Oshizu-chan, calm down.

00:20:08.010 --> 00:20:11.060
Mea, you too. I keep telling you to stop saying things like that.

00:20:11.060 --> 00:20:12.520
Okay!

00:20:13.190 --> 00:20:15.480
Kurosaki Mea-san.

00:20:15.480 --> 00:20:19.030
Is she really Yami-san's little sister?

00:20:19.860 --> 00:20:23.950
Mikan-chan, I want you to understand the circumstances.

00:20:23.950 --> 00:20:27.030
I think that for them to live properly,

00:20:27.410 --> 00:20:32.040
they need friends like Nana-chan and you.

00:20:32.370 --> 00:20:34.120
If she's Yami-san's little sister,

00:20:34.120 --> 00:20:36.840
then I should get along well with her too, shouldn't I?

00:20:36.840 --> 00:20:37.790
But...

00:20:37.790 --> 00:20:41.260
Rito-senpai, I got cotton candy on my cheek.

00:20:41.260 --> 00:20:42.590
Will you lick it off for me?

00:20:42.590 --> 00:20:45.550
I-I wonder if we can get along...

00:20:45.550 --> 00:20:46.890
Hey, you over there!

00:20:46.890 --> 00:20:49.680
What are you talking about and why aren't you watching the fireworks?

00:20:49.680 --> 00:20:51.100
Let's go, Mea!

00:20:51.100 --> 00:20:51.890
Yeah!

00:20:55.770 --> 00:20:57.360
Tearju-sensei?

00:20:57.360 --> 00:20:58.570
What is it, Momo-chan?

00:20:58.860 --> 00:21:02.900
There was one thing she said that bothers me...

00:21:04.110 --> 00:21:05.570
Darkness?!

00:21:05.570 --> 00:21:06.740
Yes.

00:21:06.740 --> 00:21:09.580
Do you know what that might mean?

00:21:10.790 --> 00:21:12.080
It couldn't be...

00:21:13.040 --> 00:21:14.960
Oh, it's nothing.

00:21:14.960 --> 00:21:15.830
I'm sorry.

00:21:15.830 --> 00:21:17.960
I don't know anything, either.

00:21:17.960 --> 00:21:19.290
Dark Nasu?

00:21:17.960 --> 00:21:19.290
TL Note: Pun on "nasu", which means eggplant.

00:21:19.960 --> 00:21:25.180
I think she was probably just speaking figuratively about Yami-chan.

00:21:25.180 --> 00:21:27.050
It's nothing to worry about.

00:21:28.470 --> 00:21:30.010
That's right.

00:21:30.010 --> 00:21:33.350
Even if that were the case, it'll be okay.

00:21:34.310 --> 00:21:36.600
As long as everyone in this city is here...

00:21:38.350 --> 00:21:40.940
As long as everyone who thinks of her is here...

00:21:49.120 --> 00:21:50.870
I'm sure it'll be okay.

